      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Parameters of haemodynamic and myocardial oxygen supply under effect of 1.0-2.0 vol.% Halothane and Enfluran were studied under conditions of surgical stress in 12 patients with IHD of the III-IV functional classes. It was found out that the heart work and oxygen demand decreased in parallel to increase in dose of anesthetics and were adequately provided by the coronary blood flow. No signs of myocardial ischemia were determined."},
